#{{ENDFOREACH}}

**These are not deployed.** No layer creates a `Microsoft.Consumption` budget
from this table, so it is the requirement and not the state. It is deliberately
not folded into the default budget above: `Deploy-Budget` places one amount on
every subscription under one management group and takes exactly two thresholds,
where this list is per-scope with as many thresholds as were entered. Merging
them would have meant either dropping thresholds somebody chose or inventing
ones they did not.

Create these by hand to match the table, and treat any divergence as drift.
